OL,3,GNEWSADad and son 'critical' after
OL,4,Aattack by masked men
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father and son are in hospital in a
OL,7,Flife threatening condition after an
OL,8,Fattack in their family home which
OL,9,Fappeared "completely unprovoked",
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,13,Fdisturbance at a house in Station Road,
OL,14,FThurnby, shortly before 00:30 BST on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FThe force said the man in his 50s and
OL,18,Fthe boy, 15, were both stabbed multiple
OL,19,Ftimes by two masked men who entered the
OL,20,Fproperty and they remained in a
OL,21,Fcritical condition in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
